FILE ARTSALDO   FB (31 0)                                                       
ARTSALDO-IDARTNR       1  5 P                                                   
ARTSALDO-IDDC          6  2 A                                                   
ARTSALDO-KVRESS        8  4 P 0                                                 
ARTSALDO-KVROS-DAG    12  4 P 0                                                 
ARTSALDO-KVROS-BULK   16  4 P 0                                                 
ARTSALDO-SUTPO-PB     20  4 P 0                                                 
ARTSALDO-SUTPO-EJPB   24  4 P 0                                                 
ARTSALDO-SUTPO-TOT    28  4 P 0                                                 
